System requirements for Playwright:
Node.js: latest 20.x, 22.x or 24.x.
Windows 11+, Windows Server 2019+ or Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL).
macOS 14 (Ventura) or later.
Debian 12 / 13, Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 (x86-64 or arm64).

brew install node

npm init playwright
node -v
npm -v


npx playwright test 
npx playwright test --headed

git checkout -b {branch_name}

git commit -m "{commit_message}"


If branch is not showing on Git then possible branch is 

git branch
git push origin your-branch-name
git remote -v
git remote add origin https://github.com/username/repo-name.git
git push -u origin your-branch-name not linked to the GitHub repo


Agents commands->npx playwright init-agents --loop=vscode

**************Test Hooks**************
test.describe - Group of tests
test.beforeEach - Runs before each test
test.afterEach - Runs after each test
**Which are executed before/after each test

test.beforeAll - Runs once before all tests in the file
test.afterAll - Runs once after all tests in the file
**which are executed once per worker before/after all tests.


Running Codegen - 
npx playwright codegen <website_url>
npx playwright test --ui - Opens Playwright Test Runner UI
npx playwright test --headed - Runs tests in headed mode
npx playwright test --project webkit - Runs tests in WebKit browser
npx playwright test --project webkit --project firefox -Runs tests in WebKit and Firefox browsers
npx playwright test --debug - Runs tests in debug mode
npx playwright test --last-failed - Runs only the tests that failed in the last run
npx playwright test --grep "test name" - Runs tests matching the specified name or pattern
npx playwright test --grep @smoke

Locator - 
If ID is present - 
css -> tagname#id or #id
xpath -> //*[@id='id']

If class attribute is present -
css -> tagname.classvalue or .classvalue

If multiple classes are present -
css -> tagname.class1.class2 or .class1.class2

Write CSS based on any attribute -
css -> tagname[attribute='value'] or [attribute='value']
If tagname is not known -
css -> [attribute='value']


Disable parallelization
npx playwright test --workers=1



Complete RAG Pipeline --
1. Data injection pipeline 
2. Query retrieval pipeline 











